title: "Boundary-Complete Relational Dynamics as a Four-Dimensional Quantum-Gravity Model: A Five-Rung Derivation to the Linearised Einstein Sector in a Coherent Near-Flat Riemannian Regime"
authors:
  - family-names: "Croydon-McRae"
