  - BCRD
abstract: >
  A five-rung synthesis of Boundary-Complete Relational Dynamics connecting an
  orientation-resolved finite-spin four-simplex amplitude through controlled
  Regge asymptotics, full-intertwiner gluing and local metric-sector recovery
  to the leading linearised Einstein-Hilbert dynamics on a near-flat
  Riemannian Dittrich-Kogios setting. The result is explicitly scope-bound.
